@startuml 23-earnings-ledger
!include _style.iuml
title Earnings ledger: one entry per confirmed booking

[*] --> PENDING : BookingConfirmedEvent\n(after commit, own transaction,\nskipped if the booking already has an entry)
PENDING --> EARNED : EarningsTimers\n(rule: see EarningsTimers)
PENDING --> REVERSED : booking fully refunded\n(amounts become 0)
EARNED --> [*]
REVERSED --> [*]

note right of PENDING
  base       = gross - refunded
  commission = base x 10 % (config), half-up
  hostAmount = base - commission
  soldOn     = confirm day (hotel time zone)
end note
note bottom of REVERSED
  The platform absorbs the provider fee on a refund;
  the host earns nothing for that booking.
  No payouts to hosts yet: the ledger records what is owed.
end note
@enduml
